# nexora-action-code: get_interface_brief
Value Required INTERFACE ((?:[0-9]+)?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*\s*\d[\w/.-]*)
Value PHY ([*^]?down|up(?:\([a-z]+\))?)
Value PROTOCOL ([*^]?down|up(?:\([a-z]+\))?)
Value INUTI (\d+(?:\.\d+)?%|--)
Value OUTUTI (\d+(?:\.\d+)?%|--)
Value INERRORS (\d+)
Value OUTERRORS (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${PHY}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${INUTI}\s+${OUTUTI}\s+${INERRORS}\s+${OUTERRORS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*(?:PHY:|\*down:|\^down:|\([a-z]+\):|InUti/OutUti:).*$$
  ^\s*Interface\s+PHY\s+Protocol\s+InUti\s+OutUti\s+inErrors\s+outErrors\s*$$
  ^\s*[-=]+\s*$$
  ^\s*<[^>]+>.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
